result.summary:
I decided all 37 places from enlarged crops and pixel maps of the .tif masters; the crops are in scratchpad/wf3/bas-b-A/crops/.

Places where reading 1 matches the print:
- the ερ ligature in -επιμερής and μέρη (29.15, 29.20, 29.21);
- the στ ligature in εἰκοστὸς (29.23);
- ἢ at 29.24;
- ἧττον and προσωνυμίας (29.5);
- βαρεί and βαρέσι (28.18, 28.24 first difference);
- Ο with no breathing (28.25);
- no hyphen at the end of 28.16, 28.22 and 29.19;
- an acute printed in μέν (30.23);
- ἰσχὺν (31.3);
- ἀπαρτίζεται (31.24);
- διατεσσάρων set solid (32.18);
- the colon after Μουσικῆς (33.21);
- the marginal «* ἡ» at 31.23;
- ἣν and τὸν at 30.5 (τὸν only at medium confidence: one ligature sort with no sigma);
- τότε at 28.13 (medium: no word space is visible).

Places where reading 2 matches the print:
- ἀνισοχρό (σο ligature) at 28.14;
- ἡπίως with a rough breathing (28.15);
- κᾀκεῖθεν with an iota-subscript dot (28.4);
- no hyphen after κα (28.24, second difference);
- ἀριθμὸς with a grave (29.18, medium);
- ρὴς (30.10);
- the misprint δείκνηται with a clear η (30.11);
- ἐμπεριέχων (30.25);
- τοῖόνδε (31.15);
- unaccented μαλλον (31.22);
- ἁρμόνικον (31.23);
- τάς with an acute (31.7);
- δυνατὸν (medium) and Αλλ’ with no breathing (32.2);
- the marginal «* τοῦ» at 32.23;
- no hyphen after ἐκτιθε (32.5);
- παιήων and the misprint ὑμεραῖος (33.12);
- χολαιοτέραις with no σ (33.15);
- μύρια (33.18).

Errors shared by both readings: at 28.14 both end with a hyphen, but nothing is printed after ό. At 29.5 I could not see the hyphen after ἔτυ either, but I did not check that one at high magnification.
